# ==========================================================================
# FLRP :: content-repos.manifest — content repo assembly list
# ==========================================================================
# COPY this file to `content-repos.manifest` (same dir) and fill in real URLs.
# The copy is gitignored; only this .example is tracked.
#
# The SSRP-style model: the CORE repo (flrp-server) holds the framework; each
# asset/content area lives in its OWN repo with its own access list. At deploy,
# `deploy/assemble.sh` clones/pulls each repo listed here into the correct
# bracketed resources folder, where FiveM discovers them. See
# docs/REPOSITORY_STRATEGY.md.
#
# Format (whitespace-separated, one repo per line):
#   <category>   <repo-name>        <git-url>                            [branch]
#
#   category   : scripts | vehicles | maps | eup | standalone | departments
#                (maps to server-data/resources/[<category>])
#   repo-name  : folder name for the clone; it is placed in a BRACKETED
#                subfolder so FiveM treats it as a resource group, e.g.
#                [vehicles]/[flrp-vehicles]/...   (also keeps it invisible to
#                the core repo via .gitignore's [<category>]/*/ rule)
#   git-url    : SSH or HTTPS URL (prefer Gitea for internal deploys)
#   branch     : optional, defaults to the repo's default branch
#
# Do NOT commit real internal URLs if they are sensitive — this list can point
# at Gitea (recommended for the deploy box) or GitHub.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------

# FLRP hub: Gitea at git.flrp.us, org `flrp`. Devs push here; Gitea
# push-mirrors each repo to GitHub (fartherr97/*) as backup. The VPS pulls
# from Gitea. See docs/GITEA_HUB.md.
#
# category      repo-name        git-url                                    branch
# ------------  ---------------  -----------------------------------------  ------
# scripts       flrp-scripts     https://git.flrp.us/flrp/flrp-scripts.git  main
# vehicles      flrp-vehicles    https://git.flrp.us/flrp/flrp-vehicles.git main
# eup           flrp-eup         https://git.flrp.us/flrp/flrp-eup.git      main
# maps          flrp-maps        https://git.flrp.us/flrp/flrp-maps.git     main
# departments   flrp-bso         https://git.flrp.us/flrp/flrp-bso.git      main
# departments   flrp-fhp         https://git.flrp.us/flrp/flrp-fhp.git      main
# departments   flrp-mpd         https://git.flrp.us/flrp/flrp-mpd.git      main
# standalone    flrp-standalone  https://git.flrp.us/flrp/flrp-standalone.git main
